  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have a mind with an uncanny knack for learning and keeping track of precise details. You gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li>Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You always know which way is north.</li><li>You always know the number of hours left before the next sunrise or sunset.</li><li>You can accurately recall anything you have seen or heard within a number of past months equal to your intelligence modifier (max 3 months).</li><li>You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.</li></ul>",
